"svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 320\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"plan\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"320\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#14171c\"/>\n<rect x=\"63.2\" y=\"106.8\" width=\"193.5\" height=\"183.9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3a4250\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<path d=\"M160.0,285.8 L211.3,143.3 L108.7,143.3 Z\" fill=\"#ffffff10\" stroke=\"#ffffff30\"/>\n<rect x=\"149.0\" y=\"278.8\" width=\"22\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#e0e0e0\"/><text x=\"140.0\" y=\"307.8\" class=\"lb\">Camera</text>\n<circle cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"160.0\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#c9a27e\"/><polygon points=\"160.0,168.2 162.9,160.0 157.1,160.0\" fill=\"#c9a27e\"/>\n<text x=\"174.0\" y=\"150.0\" class=\"lb\">Subject</text>\n<line x1=\"71.0\" y1=\"238.0\" x2=\"91.4\" y2=\"220.9\" stroke=\"#f5c542\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\" opacity=\"0.8\"/>\n<circle cx=\"71.0\" cy=\"238.0\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#f5c542\"/>\n<text x=\"57.0\" y=\"225.0\" class=\"lb\">600d through a branch</text>\n<line x1=\"213.2\" y1=\"255.6\" x2=\"199.9\" y2=\"232.5\" stroke=\"#7fb3ff\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\" opacity=\"0.8\"/>\n<circle cx=\"213.2\" cy=\"255.6\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#7fb3ff\"/>\n<text x=\"199.2\" y=\"242.6\" class=\"lb\">Soft fill</text>\n</svg>",
"look": "Sun through leaves. Soft-edged branch shadows on the wall and a little dapple on the actor make a day interior feel alive.",
"html": "<p>A real branch (or the planner's branch pattern) on a C-stand in front of the 600d with its Hyper Reflector. There's no lens, so the softness of the leaves comes from distance: the closer the branch is to the subject, the sharper the shadow.</p>",
"lights": [
{
"label": "600d through a branch",
"fixture": "Aputure LS 600d",
"modifier": "Hyper Reflector (55 degree)",
"dist_m": 2.56,
"dist_ft": 8.4,
"where": "50° camera left, 3.0 ft (0.90 m) above the eyes",
"power": 3,
"cct": 5600
},
{
"label": "Soft fill",
"fixture": "Nanlite PavoSlim 120C",
"modifier": "Softbox (included)",
"dist_m": 2.2,
"dist_ft": 7.2,
"where": "30° camera right, 0.3 ft (0.10 m) above the eyes",
"power": 6,
"cct": 5600
}
],
"props": [],
"camera": {
"body": "Blackmagic PYXIS 6K",
"lens": "50 mm",
"exposure": "T4, ISO 800, 1/50, 5600 K",
"meter": "308 lux (T4 +1/3)"
},
"steps": [
"Put the 600d on the heavy-duty stand about 8 feet from the subject, high, like the sun.",
"Hold a leafy branch on a C-stand arm about two thirds of the way from the light to the subject.",
"Slide it toward the subject until the leaves read. Wiggle it gently during the take for wind.",
"Fill the shadow side softly (the PavoSlim) so the dapple doesn't turn into black holes."
],
"watch": [
"Real branches wilt and shed under heat. Bring a spare.",
"A branch too close to the light gives a blurry mess. Move it toward the subject.",
"The C-stand holding the branch is a sail outdoors. Bag it."
],
"vary": [
"Use the FL-20G Fresnel spotted in for a crisper sun.",
"Try the leaf breakup pattern, or a plant from the house."
],
